'' -app IS AN ANDROID APP (docs/tiko-android A4), so it refuses any other target before compiling
'' anything: a shared libmain.so with SDL_main is meaningless on Windows or Linux.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -app -target linux-x86_64 tests/source/plain.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 2
'' EXPECT-OUT: TKO0195: '-app' builds an Android app; target 'linux-x86_64' is not android-x86_64 or android-arm64
